# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# The repo root .gitignore has a *.lock rule (for an unrelated Xcode lock
# file) that would otherwise also swallow this one — Cargo.lock should be
# committed for an application so builds stay reproducible.
!Cargo.lock
